{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude98 Ready to build and grow the car dealership of your dreams?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Car Dealer Life Simulator</strong> throws you into the thrilling journey of becoming a car dealer from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy used cars, perform detailed inspections, repair, clean, and sell them for profit.<br>Negotiate with customers, use financial systems wisely, expand your dealership, and become a king in the auto trade world!<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfea Build and manage your own car dealership from the ground up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97 Realistic used car market (including mileage, engine status, tire condition, vehicle age, and more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf0 Increase vehicle value through repairs, maintenance, and washing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac Negotiate with NPC customers and evaluate their offers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb8 Dynamic economy with price fluctuations, seasonal discounts, and shifting market trends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfe6 Take out loans from banks, manage interest rates, and control your cash flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 Borrow money from the mafia \u2014 a risky but fast source of capital</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc9 Avoid bankruptcy by making smart decisions and managing your spending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf Level up and improve your player skills to become a master trader</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 Expand your business, open new branches, and dominate the auto market<br><br><br>\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Gameplay Videos</strong><br><strong></strong><br>\ud83c\udfe1 [Luxury Cars &amp; Real Estate]<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755670/extras/Devam2103ast2025.05.24-19.48.07.28online-video-cutter.com-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-conver